Each evidence block should preserve:

- Stable `chunk_id`
- Source document identifier
- Heading path
- Page or page range when available
- Retrieval rank and similarity score
- Original chunk text

Use a clearly delimited, human-readable evidence format, for example:

[EVIDENCE]
chunk_id: chunk_abc123
source: employee_policy.md
section: Expense Reimbursement Rules
page: not available
rank: 1
similarity: 0.82

Text:
The original retrieved chunk text.
[/EVIDENCE]

This is an example format; use the actual metadata schema.

